    <section class="content-section section-shell" id="what"><div class="section-intro split-intro"><div><span class="section-kicker">PROPERTY CHAIN INTELLIGENCE</span><h2>What is EST8ADS?</h2></div><p>EST8ADS is a Property Chain Intelligence platform based on Villa Bit AI technology, built for private buyers, sellers and real estate agents. Private and one-time users can publish one property move request for 30 days for $12, while real estate agencies using Villa Bit AI receive unlimited free EST8ADS publishing through the fully integrated Villa Bit AI Server.</p></div><div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature-card featured"><div class="feature-visual chain-visual"><div class="chain-dot one"></div><div class="chain-dot two"></div><div class="chain-dot three"></div><div class="chain-dot four"></div><div class="chain-center">8</div></div><h3>Connect complete property moves</h3><p>Our AI technology connects compatible property moves into potential transaction chains. EST8ADS works with a minimum of two connected transactions at the same time: selling one property and buying the next one, or the reverse.</p></article><article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-number">01</div><h3>More than one transaction</h3><p>Property chains are often much larger. Through deep AI analysis, Villa Bit AI can connect multiple sales and purchases at the same time as one complete property chain.</p></article><article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-number">02</div><h3>Identify the missing link</h3><p>EST8ADS can identify the specific buyer, seller, property or condition that is preventing the entire chain from moving forward.</p></article><article class="feature-card wide"><div class="missing-link-graphic"><span>SALE</span><i></i><span>PURCHASE</span><i class="broken"></i><b>?</b><i></i><span>SALE</span></div><div><h3>One ordinary property may unlock several sales</h3><p>EST8ADS gives real estate agencies valuable information about which property should be advertised more strongly or receive more sales effort. That one property may be much more valuable than it first appears because one successful move can unlock multiple sales further down the chain.</p></div></article></div></section>

    <section class="how-section" id="how"><div class="section-shell"><div class="section-intro centered light-text"><span class="section-kicker">HOW A PROPERTY CHAIN WORKS</span><h2>One complete solution instead of separate waiting</h2><p>EST8ADS analyzes the complete transaction structure for you on a more advanced, algorithm-based level.</p></div><div class="steps"><article class="step-card"><span class="step-number">01</span><h3>Tell us your next move</h3><p>Add at the same time the property you want to sell and the property you want to buy, including your price range, preferred location, timing and any conditions that must be met.</p></article><article class="step-card"><span class="step-number">02</span><h3>We build possible property chains</h3><p>EST8ADS compares your buying and selling requests using advanced AI technology. It analyzes compatible buyers, sellers and properties to identify direct matches and build connected property chain transactions.</p></article><article class="step-card"><span class="step-number">03</span><h3>We find the complete solution or missing link</h3><p>Villa Bit AI Property Chain Intelligence finds a matching buyer or seller for you at the same time. If the chain cannot move forward, it identifies the one missing property, buyer, seller or condition that could unlock the greatest number of sales.</p></article><article class="step-card"><span class="step-number">04</span><h3>Unlock multiple sales</h3><p>When the complete solution or the missing link is found, several connected property transactions may be able to move forward. Each participant keeps their own agent, agreements, fees and control over their transaction.</p></article></div></div></section>

