          ["Does EST8ADS take over an agent's client?",'No. Client identities, contact details, representation and communication remain controlled according to platform permissions, existing agreements and applicable law.'],['Do agencies have to share commissions?','No. EST8ADS does not require commission sharing. Each agency may retain its own client, agreement, communication and compensation arrangement.'],['Is EST8ADS a real estate agency?','EST8ADS is primarily a technology, advertising, intelligence and coordination platform. Licensed brokerage and other regulated professional services must be provided by appropriately authorized professionals under separate agreements where required.'],['What do agencies using Villa Bit AI receive?','Real estate agencies using Villa Bit AI can publish unlimited EST8ADS property move requests free of charge through the fully integrated Villa Bit AI Server.'],['Where can an agency learn more about Villa Bit AI?','Agencies can visit Villa Bit AI at https://villabit.ai to learn about the integrated AI Server and unlimited EST8ADS publishing access.'],['Can agencies use EST8ADS under their own brand?','Selected agency tools may include white-label intake forms, website widgets, campaign tools, dashboards, team access, analytics and agency-facing interfaces.'],['How can EST8ADS help an agency move more transactions forward?','EST8ADS can help identify whether a deal is blocked by a missing property, buyer, financing issue, timing conflict or unverified participant. One client who must both sell and buy may also connect the agency to more than one transaction.'],
        ]],
        ['05','Privacy and verification',[
          ['Will my name and contact details be public?','No. Public Missing Link Ads use privacy-safe information. Personal contact details are not automatically published or released to everyone in a possible chain.'],['What information may be shown publicly?','A public ad may show the required property type, general location, budget range, verification level, number of connected transactions, estimated chain value, target timeline and a privacy-safe summary.'],['Why is verification needed?','Verification helps distinguish genuine transaction-ready participants from casual or inaccurate enquiries and improves the quality of matching and chain analysis.'],['What does Chain Ready mean?','Chain Ready means that a participant has completed the required verification level, confirmed the main conditions and indicated a willingness to proceed if a suitable chain is completed.'],['Does verification guarantee ownership, funds or legal status?','No. Verification indicates that specific information or documents were reviewed according to the platform process. It is not a substitute for formal legal, financial, title, valuation, inspection or due-diligence work.'],['How are responses to a Missing Link Ad reviewed?','A person responding to an ad does not automatically receive private participant details. EST8ADS first checks whether the property, buyer or seller is relevant before an approved privacy-safe match summary is shared.'],
        ]],
        ['06','Pricing, fees and results',[
          ['How much does EST8ADS cost for a private or one-time user?','A private person or one-time user pays $12 to publish one property move request for 30 days and receive access to EST8ADS AI Server analysis.'],['What does the $12 fee cover?','The fee covers publication of one property move request for 30 days and use of the EST8ADS AI Server system for deeper property-chain analysis. It is a technology and advertising service fee.'],['Is the $12 fee a real estate commission?','No. EST8ADS does not request or receive a commission from a property sale. The fee is for publishing the request and using the AI Server system.'],['How long does one private request stay active?','One private or one-time property move request stays active for 30 days. A new payment or plan may be required to continue after that period.'],['Is EST8ADS free for real estate agencies?','Real estate agencies using Villa Bit AI receive unlimited free EST8ADS publishing through the integrated Villa Bit AI Server. Other agency services or plans may have separate terms.'],['Does EST8ADS guarantee a buyer, seller or completed sale?','No. EST8ADS provides matching, deeper AI analytics, advertising and coordination tools, but it does not guarantee a buyer, seller, property match, sale, purchase, selling price, timing, financing or completed transaction.'],['What results can the AI analysis provide?','The AI may identify useful matches, potential chains, sales opportunities, weak points, blocked conditions or stalled stages. These insights may help a transaction move forward, but every result remains conditional.'],['Are professional brokerage, legal and financial services included?','No. Real estate brokerage, legal, tax, valuation, inspection, financing, notarial, escrow and closing services may be regulated and must be provided by appropriately licensed or authorized professionals under separate agreements where required.'],['Who is responsible for due diligence and final decisions?','Every participant remains responsible for their own agent, legal and tax advice, inspections, valuation, due diligence, contracts, professional fees and final transaction decisions.'],['Are chain counts, readiness scores and estimated values guaranteed?','No. Chain counts, readiness scores, estimated values, matches and projected outcomes are informational and may change as participant data, market conditions, verification and transaction requirements change.'],
